{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S06、S11 等处压缩心理因果时不如 X 交代得直接，尤其人物为什么感到孤单、为什么愿意继续陪伴，需要多想一下。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的重点词加亮，能让观众扫一眼就抓住人物当下的心理变化；感受又按音乐进程出现，不必一次处理所有信息，具体的声音、身体感受和意象也让情绪变化更有层次。反复出现的水波、船、摇荡、靠岸和锚定等意象，把音乐变化与人物关系串成了一条线；X 的优势是叙事因果更完整，但感受词同时堆在一侧，音乐细节的先后和情绪转折不如 Y 容易体会。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3ec0ee1b-7d9c-45fe-b757-3b13eec4038c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T154524636693Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:46:39.469197+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0703f48c73b19e9626599838b3a4b889c8198e6db53ef89115a70e9ff3eeb7d6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_atta